00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:24.524 line:85%
HE TOLD US A REMARKABLE STORY.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.860 line:85%
JOE BIDEN'S SON AND BROTHER HAD

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:27.560 line:85%
ENTERED INTO HIGHLY LUCRATIVE

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.495 line:85%
DEALS WITH FOREIGN GOVERNMENTS

