00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.734 line:85%
GOVERNMENT IN EXCHANGE FOR

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:35.702 line:85%
MILLIONS OF DOLLARS FOR

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.904 line:85%
THEMSELVES.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.371 line:85%
NOW ON MANY LEVELS, THAT WAS A

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:40.573 line:85%
CRIME.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.207 line:85%
JOE BIDEN WAS AWARE OF IT WHEN

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:44.344 line:85%
IT HAPPENED AND JOE BIDEN

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:45.945 line:85%
PROFITED FROM IT DIRECTLY.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.747 line:85%
IT WAS A STRONG CHARGE TO MAKE

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:49.115 line:85%
BUT TONY BOB BELINSKY HAD THE

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:51.484 line:85%
DOCUMENTS, E-MAILS AND TEXT

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:52.986 line:85%
MESSAGES TO PROVED IT HAPPEN.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:56.056 line:85%
WE CONSIDERED IT A HUGE STORY

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.489 line:85%
AND WE SPENT AN HOUR ON IT IN

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.091 line:85%
OCTOBER 2020.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.858 line:85%
TWO YEARS LATER WE STILL

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.195 line:85%
CONSIDER IT A HUGE STORY.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:02.929 line:85%
IN ALL OF THAT TIME NO OTHER

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.398 line:85%
MAJOR NEWS ORGANIZATION IN THIS

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.665 line:85%
COUNTRY HAS BOTHERED TO FOLLOW

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.433 line:85%
UP.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:08.535 line:85%
THE NEW YORK TIMES NEVER

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.936 line:85%
INTERVIEWED TONY AS PART OF THE

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:10.670 line:85%
INVESTIGATION INTO THE BIDEN

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:12.572 line:85%
FAMILY BUSINESS DEALS, WHICH IS

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.541 line:85%
STRANGE BECAUSE HE WAS A PARTNER

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.009 line:85%
WITH THE BIDEN FAMILY.

