BUT NEITHER HAS THE WASHINGTON

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.877 line:85%
POST.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.511 line:85%
NEITHER HAVE THE OTHER

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:19.746 line:85%
TELEVISION NETWORKS.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:22.282 line:85%
THEY HAVE IGNORED IT.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:25.151 line:85%
THE FBI, WHOSE JOB IT IS TO

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:26.920 line:85%
ENFORCE FEDERAL LAW, DID TAKE A

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.354 line:85%
LENGTHY STATEMENT FROM TONY

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.522 line:85%
BOBULINSKI BACK IN 2020 AND

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.223 line:85%
DURING THAT CONVERSATION HE

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:33.326 line:85%
OUTLINED SEVERAL FELONIES THE

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.927 line:85%
BIDEN GIRL S HAD COMMITTED.

