00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:24.911 line:85%
DANGEROUSLY POLITICIZED AND

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.278 line:85%
CORRUPTED OUR LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.012 line:85%
AGENCIES.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.681 line:85%
BEFORE VOTERS MAKE THAT DECISION

